{
  "name": "GD·06 Nurture · email",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## GD·06 Nurture (Boss 5 · D6, from 5.6)\nBrevo, from an authenticated domain (SPF, DKIM, DMARC pass), consented contacts only.\n1. Hourly: customers who ticked consent at checkout → Brevo contact (attributes + list) and LAST_ORDER_DATE kept current. The welcome series and the 60-day win-back run as Brevo automations on that list and attribute.\n2. Thursday 10:00: AI drafts the newsletter → CODE blocks any price or discount not on the approved lists → Tolu approves → campaign created in Brevo.\n3. Thursday 17:00: send the approved campaign, unless campaigns are paused.\n4. Monday 07:00: last campaign's stats; complaints over 0.1% pause the next campaign and alert Tolu; stats logged for GD·07.\n5. Brevo webhook (unsubscribed, hard bounce, spam complaint) → suppression for ALL channels, consent off, the same minute.\n\n**Credentials:** Postgres, Brevo API key (Header Auth \"Brevo\": api-key), OpenAI, Telegram. **Env:** BREVO_WEBHOOK_TOKEN.\n**Replace:** YOUR_BREVO_LIST_ID, news@mail.harvestlane.example, YOUR_MODEL, YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "fbe63f34-0909-4ec0-8c2e-7e02b43448d9",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
